la che viene scoperta a fumare sul tetto dell’edificio scolastico. Per ricambiare il suo gesto, questa ragazza di nome Sally (Emma Roberts) lo introduce ad una vita estremamente mondana, fatta di feste, visite ai musei e passeggiate oziose per la città.","tagline":"La lezione piú dura è l'amore."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"George, a lonely and fatalistic teen who's made it all the way to his senior year without ever having done a real day of work, is befriended by Sally, a popular but complicated girl who recognizes in him a kindred spirit.","tagline":"The toughest lesson is love."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4aySElPLnHtReLsGYfE4P1HY5Nx.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4aySElPLnHtReLsGYfE4P1HY5Nx.png","language":"en","width":4304,"height":1289},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRWBjMC4lJZsABVK8PtjFurXqLh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xRWBjMC4lJZsABVK8PtjFurXqLh.png","language":"en","width":4308,"height":1289}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfi0h0OmEsI8yfLx1mZveBDZmi6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfi0h0OmEsI8yfLx1mZveBDZmi6.jpg","language":"it","width":566,"height":850},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gwBHq8QMz4Uf8t3awpA7JUJOWG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gwBHq8QMz4Uf8t3awpA7JUJOWG.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ahdKyzHbYhvqJdtpsEWipEai98.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ahdKyzHbYhvqJdtpsEWipEai98.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9bn6aVPfwwigozCI1WZgHbY22Zz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9bn6aVPfwwigozCI1WZgHbY22Zz.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pGdb3GSZgPZ29IIlkgGiX9ia